<title>FINLAND: MATTI BYMAN TO GYLLENBERG FUNDS FROM ALFRED BERG.</title>
<headline>MATTI BYMAN TO GYLLENBERG FUNDS FROM ALFRED BERG.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish brokerage Gyllenberg Asset Management Pankkiiriliike Oy on Friday said it had appointed Matti Byman managing director of its unit trust arm Gyllenberg Rahasto Oy.</p>
<p>Byman will join Gyllenberg from Alfred Berg Rahasto Oy, Gyllenberg said in a statement.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 235</p>
</text>
